sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant Word
    participant Addin
    participant Editor
    participant Mermaid
    participant Document
    participant Storage
    participant Server

    User->>Browser: Open Word Online
    Browser->>Word: Load document
    Word->>Addin: Start add-in
    Addin->>Server: Load application
    Server-->>Addin: Return application
    Addin->>Editor: Initialize editor
    Editor-->>Addin: Editor ready
    Addin->>Mermaid: Initialize Mermaid
    Mermaid-->>Addin: Mermaid ready

    User->>Addin: Click New Diagram
    Addin->>Editor: Create new document
    Editor-->>Addin: Editor ready

    User->>Editor: Enter Mermaid source
    Editor->>Mermaid: Validate source
    Mermaid-->>Editor: Source is valid
    Editor->>Mermaid: Render diagram
    Mermaid-->>Editor: Return SVG
    Editor->>Browser: Display preview
    Browser-->>User: Show diagram preview

    User->>Editor: Change diagram source
    Editor->>Mermaid: Validate source
    Mermaid-->>Editor: Source is valid
    Editor->>Mermaid: Render diagram
    Mermaid-->>Editor: Return SVG
    Editor->>Browser: Update preview
    Browser-->>User: Show updated preview

    User->>Addin: Click Insert
    Addin->>Mermaid: Render final diagram
    Mermaid-->>Addin: Return SVG
    Addin->>Document: Insert diagram
    Document-->>Addin: Diagram inserted
    Addin->>Storage: Save diagram metadata
    Storage-->>Addin: Metadata saved
    Addin-->>User: Diagram inserted

    User->>Document: Select diagram
    Document-->>Addin: Selection changed
    Addin->>Document: Find Mermaid ContentControl
    Document-->>Addin: Return diagram ID
    Addin->>Storage: Load Mermaid source
    Storage-->>Addin: Return Mermaid source
    Addin->>Editor: Open diagram for editing
    Editor-->>User: Display Mermaid source

    User->>Editor: Modify source
    Editor->>Mermaid: Validate source
    Mermaid-->>Editor: Source is valid
    Editor->>Mermaid: Render diagram
    Mermaid-->>Editor: Return SVG
    Editor->>Browser: Display updated preview
    Browser-->>User: Show updated diagram

    User->>Addin: Click Update
    Addin->>Mermaid: Render diagram
    Mermaid-->>Addin: Return SVG
    Addin->>Document: Replace existing diagram
    Document-->>Addin: Diagram updated
    Addin->>Storage: Update Mermaid source
    Storage-->>Addin: Source updated
    Addin-->>User: Diagram updated

    User->>Document: Save document
    Document->>Storage: Persist document
    Storage-->>Document: Document saved

    User->>Browser: Close Word
    Browser->>Word: Close document
    Word-->>Browser: Document closed
    Browser-->>User: Application closed
